{"title":"Nasty E Liquid","description":"\u003cp\u003eExperience the epitome of vaping excellence with Nasty E-Liquid, now available in Kenya! Our premium Nasty vape liquid boasts an array of enticing flavors, carefully crafted to tantalize your taste buds. \u003cspan\u003e Available with nicotine strengths of 0mg-18mg, 10ml nicotine salts with 10mg and 20mg nicotine strength, 50ml shortfills. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"nasty-juice-wicked-haze-e-liquid","title":"Nasty Juice Wicked Haze E Liquid","description":"\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eWicked Haze shortfill e-liquid is inspired by a popular beverage; with ripe notes of blackcurrants and a zesty lemonade flavour, you'll find a tangy and tart fruit taste throughout. This is finished off with a low mint, to give you a cooling menthol taste that ties everything together.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eWicked Haze 50ml e-liquid is available as a 70% VG, 50ml shortfill, ideal for sub ohm vaping. Should you wish to vape with nicotine, we'd recommend you add a 10ml nic shot of your choice.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eBrought to you by Nasty Juice; a Malaysian based e-liquid brand passionate about creating high-end, authentic tasting flavours at affordable prices. Their shortfill range features fresh, fruity and clean flavour notes in a high VG mix, so you can be sure to create big clouds with an even bigger flavour!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e50ml of E-liquid in a 60ml Shortfill Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Mint Series by Nasty Juice\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDouble Fruity Series by Nasty Juice\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpace For a 10ml Nic Shot\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e70% VG \/ 30% PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDesigned for Sub Ohm Vaping\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in Malaysia\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChildproof Cap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTamper Evident Seal\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRecyclable Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41652564262967,"sku":"Nasty Juice Wicked Haze 3 mg","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"6MG","offer_id":41652564295735,"sku":"Nasty Juice Wicked Haze 6 mg","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-juice-wicked-haze-eliquid-shortfill-bottle-with-box.jpg?v=1746639871"},{"product_id":"nasty-juice-cushman-mango-grape","title":"Nasty Juice Cushman Mango Grape E Liquid","description":"\u003cp\u003eMango Grape Low Mint by Nasty Cush Man 60ml is a remarkably refreshing freebase e liquid flavor. The two fruits join forces to rejuvenate your palate and obliterate your thirst. The mild menthol finish cools you off when you’re feeling the heat. If you’re looking for a cool and satisfying ejuice for the scorching days of summer.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAs you inhale, exquisite tang from the grape and mango juices travels across the tongue, revitalizing every taste bud. When you exhale, the sweetness of the fruits comes through as a breeze of mild menthol cools your palate.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is a must-have flavor for fruit fanatics who are in need of something that’s profoundly refreshing.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBrand Name :\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eNasty Juice\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSeries:\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eCushman Low Mint\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFlavor :\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eMango, Grape, Mint\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVG\/PG: \u003c\/strong\u003e70VG\/30PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eNicotine\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e Strength: \u003c\/strong\u003e0mg, 3mg \u0026amp; 6mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eContent:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e \u003c\/strong\u003e60 ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41652567244855,"sku":"Nasty Juice Cushman Mango Grape 3 mg","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"6MG","offer_id":41652567277623,"sku":"Nasty Juice Cushman Mango Grape 6 mg","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"0MG","offer_id":41652567310391,"sku":"Nasty Juice Cushman Mango Grape 0 mg","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-juice-cushman-mango-grape-60ml.jpg?v=1746640081"},{"product_id":"nasty-juice-cushman-mango-strawberry","title":"Nasty Juice Cushman Mango Strawberry E Liquid","description":"\u003cp\u003eMango Strawberry Low Mint by Nasty Cush Man 60ml Freebase combines mango and strawberry juices with the Nasty Juice’s signature low mint. It’ll rejuvenate you with fruity goodness before delivering a cool stream of mint that isn’t as intense as pure menthol. Like a gentle summer breeze, this e liquid will leave you feeling refreshed and mellow.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eEvery puff douses your tongue in succulent fruity flavors before cooling you off with some chilly mint. You’ll taste the freshness of each flavor component as the vapor glides over your palate.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAs you inhale Mango Strawberry Low Mint ejuice, the sharp and bright strawberry flavor teases your tongue with sweetness and tang. Then, the tropical mango juice bathes every taste bud. On the exhale, mint invigorates your senses.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBrand Name :\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eNasty Juice\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSeries:\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eCushman Low Mint\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFlavor :\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eMango, Grape, Mint\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVG\/PG: \u003c\/strong\u003e70VG\/30PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eNicotine\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e Strength: \u003c\/strong\u003e0mg, 3mg \u0026amp; 6mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eContent:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e \u003c\/strong\u003e60 ml \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41652567474231,"sku":"Nasty Juice Cushman Mango Strawberry 3 mg","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"6MG","offer_id":41652567506999,"sku":"Nasty Juice Cushman Mango Strawberry 6 mg","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"0MG","offer_id":41652567539767,"sku":"Nasty Juice Cushman Mango Strawberry 0 mg","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-cushman-mango-strawberry-eliquid-juice.jpg?v=1746640085"},{"product_id":"nasty-juice-cushman-mango-banana","title":"Nasty Juice Cushman Mango Banana E Liquid","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhat’s more refreshing than a blend of tropical fruits and cool mint? Mango Banana Low Mint by Nasty Cush Man 60ml Freebase is a fruity and minty ejuice that exhilarates your palate in every way. Made by the same guys who brought us Nasty Juice, this flavor really hits the spot when you’re feeling thirsty.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you’re devoted to tropical fruit flavors, Mango Banana Low Mint e liquid needs to be in your collection.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBrand Name :\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eNasty Juice\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSeries:\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eCushman Low Mint\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFlavor :\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eMango, Grape, Mint\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVG\/PG: \u003c\/strong\u003e70VG\/30PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eNicotine\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e Strength: \u003c\/strong\u003e0mg, 3mg \u0026amp; 6mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eContent:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e \u003c\/strong\u003e60 ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41652567572535,"sku":"Nasty Juice Cushman Mango Banana 3 mg","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"6MG","offer_id":41652567605303,"sku":"Nasty Juice Cushman Mango Banana 6 mg","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"0MG","offer_id":41652567638071,"sku":"Nasty Juice Cushman Mango Banana 0 mg","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-e-liquid-cushman-mango-banana-juice.jpg?v=1746640089"}],"url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nasty-e-liquid.oembed","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




